      "level": "Intermediate",
      "muscles": "Shoulders · Forearms · Core",
      "desc": "An overhead stroke with the same preparation as a clear or smash, but the racket decelerates or slices at contact so the shuttle falls just over the net. Its value is deception — if the opponent can read it from your swing, it becomes a free net kill for them.",
